 abs\, independent tinkerers)\; 18+ and legal resident of an eligible juris
 diction\; one account per person\; participants are responsible for comply
 ing with school or employer policies. DEADLINE: the platform lists final s
 ubmissions closing 2 October 2026\, midnight UTC (some announcements said 
 25 September\, so check the platform for your track). Free to enter.\n\nOr
 ganisation: Mozilla Data Collective (Mozilla Foundation)\nLocation: Online
 \, worldwide. Participants must be 18+ (and of age of majority in their ju
 risdiction) and legal residents of an eligible territory\; residents of so
 me territories are excluded from prizes.\nAward: USD 20\,000 total in priz
 es across three language tracks (per track: USD 4\,000 for first place and
